concept:australian-heritage-commission-short-title-amendment-act-1976-sec-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5 Section 5"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-5 ;
    values:originalText "Section 8 of the Principal Act is amended— (a) by inserting, after the word “ authorities” (first occurring), the words “of the Commonwealth and”; and (b) by adding at the end thereof the words “ and, in particular, without limiting the generality of the foregoing, shall consult with the Director of National Parks and Wildlife in relation to any matter that concerns the establishment or management of a park or reserve under the National Parks and Wildlife Conser­ vation Act 1975”. Membership" ;
    skos:definition "Section 8 of the Principal Act is amended— (a) by inserting, after the word “ authorities” (first occurring), the words “of the Commonwealth and”; and (b) by adding at the end thereof the words “ and, in particular, without limiting the generality of the foregoing, shall consult with the Director of National Parks and Wildlife in relation to any matter that concerns the establishment or management of a park or reserve under the National Parks and Wildlife Conser­ vation Act 1975”. Membership"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "dd85529756dffafcd2bd9882334911b945a63b0e348ca4a535e7da58ebc38e0f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "2"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "State must consult with Director of National Parks and Wildlife in relation to park or reserve management." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-heritage-commission-short-title-amendment-act-1976.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-heritage-commission-short-title-amendment-act-1976.pdf, p.2" ;
