    skos:prefLabel "8 Section 8"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-8 ;
    values:originalText "Section 32 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting sub- Staff of sections (2) and (3) and substituting the following sub-section: — Commission. “ (2) The use of the services of the Staff of the Commission by Com­ missioners is subject to the control of the Chairman. ”." ;
